      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "How would you define a person you \"met\" in a game where interactions are not always even based on talking to each other (a lot of people are mute)? Looking at each other is not a feasible way either, because mirrors... Other way would be distance or straight out displaying all people that went through an instance you have been in (already possible with output logs), but you could sit in a world like The Great Pug or Summer Solitude for one hour straight and during that over 100 can actually go through it (people leave and join worlds like that quite often).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
