      "value": "@{5dcae10f2fb049260da562f6|full_name}: yes but what does that matter? it would be a log of the people that were in the same world. if you wanna get fancy with it you could also sort it by worlds or something. it should be fairly easy to implement and i dont ser any reason why its not a thing from the get go..... it actually makes no sense not to have this feature imo. i literally had the situation twice yesterday and i dont know how i find that log or what you were talking about. makes me just sad to bond with people and never see them again because we crash.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
