      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ee63781f8e53a1391787dfa|full_name}: I agree with you here, I like the idea of sorting it all by worlds. One thing to help build on that is to perhaps is to show player proximity results. Hear me out lol. Like VRchat would be taking note of people that are in proximity of each other, so it would help you sort through all the people that potentially joined that world you were in. While overtime your proximity percentage goes up the longer you were nearby someone. With the logs showing who you were nearby throughout your playtime would definitely help you find a lost friend :)",
